- Build-time JS eval usage (frontend tooling, not runtime server):
  - repo/kystudio/build/explore-chinese.js:200-206 shows eval used to parse local source text during a build-time scan: [repo/kystudio/build/explore-chinese.js:200-206]
    * Lines: (nl output) 200-206 contain:
      200	function findLocalesLastIndex(string = '', lastIndex) {
      201	  try {
      202	    eval(`cacheResult = ${string};`);
      203	    return lastIndex;
      204	  } catch {
      205	    const removedResult = cutToLastChar(string.slice(0, string.length - 1), '}');
      206	    return removedResult.text ? findLocalesLastIndex(removedResult.text, removedResult.lastIndex) : null;
      207	  }
      208	}
